ran <strong>=C3=BCst=C3=BCn teknik y=C3=B6nler</strong></span></li>
</ul><span style=3D"color: rgb(0,0,0);">k=C4=B1sa, net ve k=C4=B1yaslanabi=
lir bi=C3=A7imde a=C3=A7=C4=B1klanmal=C4=B1d=C4=B1r.</span><span style=3D"=
color: rgb(0,0,0);">=F0=9F=93=8C <strong>=C3=96nerilen Yaz=C4=B1m Yakla=C5=
