t=C3=BCr =C3=B6zeti (varsa)</span></li>
</ul><h3 id=3D"ODEA028Yaz=C4=B1l=C4=B1mGeli=C5=9FtirmeProjeYaz=C4=B1mTasla=
=C4=9F=C4=B1-Bub=C3=B6l=C3=BCmdemutlakayeralmas=C4=B1gerekenler"><span sty=
le=3D"color: rgb(0,0,0);">Bu b=C3=B6l=C3=BCmde mutlaka yer almas=C4=B1 ger=
ekenler</span></h3>
<ul>
<li style=3D"color: rgb(0,0,0);"><span style=3D"color: rgb(0,0,0);">Projen=
in <strong>hedefleri</strong> ve <strong>ba=C5=9Far=C4=B1 kriterleri</stro=
ng> (KPI)</span></li>
